{title: My Peace I Give to You}
{subtitle: John 14:26–27}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Eb] | [Bb] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The [Bb]Advocate the Father sends
In Je[Eb]sus' name to you
[Bb]He will teach you [F/A]all things
And [Gm]remind you of the [Eb]way
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Peace I [F/A]leave with [Gm7]you
[Gm7/D][Eb]My peace I [Bb/D]give to [F]you
Not [Gm7]as the world gives
[F/A]Do not let [Bb]your hearts be [Eb]troubled
[Cm7]Do not [F]be af[Bb]raid [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]I have told you [F/A]these things
While I [Eb]am still with you
The [Gm7]word you hear is [F/A]from the Father
[Eb]Who sent me to guide you
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Peace I [F/A]leave with [Gm7]you
[Gm7/D][Eb]My peace I [Bb/D]give to [F]you
Not [Gm7]as the world gives
[F/A]Do not let [Bb]your hearts be [Eb]troubled
[Cm7]Do not be [F]af[Bb]raid
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb]He will re[F]mind you of [Bb]everything
[Eb]I [F]have said to [Gm][Gm7/F]you
[Eb]You will [F]not be left a[Gm7]lone
In the [Eb]light of the [F]Spirit
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Gm7]Peace I [F/A]leave with [Gm7]you
[Eb]My peace I [Bb/D]give to [F]you
Not as [Gm7]the world gives
[F/A]Do not let [Bb]your hearts be [Eb]troubled
[Cm7]Do not be [F]af[Bb]raid
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Eb]Do not [F]be af[Gm7]raid
My [Cm7]peace I give [F]to [Bb]you [Eb][Bb]
{end_of_verse}
